The Unit suite is declared in packages/suite/phpunit.xml, the root phpunit.xml
and tests/Pest.php, and the package has no unit tests yet — wire-suite is an
installer, so what there is to test is the command end to end.

This file is why the directory survives. Git does not track an empty directory,
so a clone would arrive without it and Pest aborts the whole run on a declared
test directory that is not there ("Test directory ... not found"), taking every
other package's tests with it. That is a failure with no connection to whatever
change is being tested, on a machine that has never been wrong before.

Delete this once there is a real test beside it.
